{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n\n<p>發佈時間：13:00 2026-11-04 HKT</p>\n<img alt=\"陳詠詩卸任港姐冠軍即派福利  化身性感天使谷出豐滿上圍極盡誘惑  霸氣發文：乖乖跪低\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/813475cf31dcf6d84e337a770fbc09c5/2026-11/Copy_of_KF__17.png\"/>\n<p>2025年港姐冠軍「學霸女神」陳詠詩日前在社交平台大派福利，分享一組極具視覺衝擊的超性感「天使」美照，並配文寫道：「乖乖跪低聽命」，隨即引爆網民熱議。相中的她化身性感天使，頭戴天使光環，背後配上小巧的白色羽毛翅膀，清純之餘更添幾分調皮。最吸睛的是她穿上一件超貼身的純白喱士吊帶馬甲，低胸剪裁配合胸前的黑色蝴蝶結與交叉綁帶設計，將其傲人的豐滿上圍展露無遺，性感尺度爆燈。</p>\n<h2>陳詠詩化身天使谷出魔鬼身材</h2>\n<p>陳詠詩不僅穿上性感天使裝，精緻妝容更在眼角點綴了閃亮裝飾，對著鏡頭展示甜美笑容，散發著無可抗拒的女人味。她身上僅配戴簡約項鏈與細緻手鏈，讓視覺焦點完全集中在她白皙肌膚與魔鬼身材上。這張「天使與魔鬼」結合的美照一出，大批網民紛紛激讚她「簡直是人間天使」、「身材好到犯規」，更有網民笑言看到她的霸氣發文，真的願意「乖乖跪低」。</p>\n<img alt=\"陳詠詩家境富裕，為米業大亨、慈善家陳瑞祺的曾孫女。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/e8c19168391fa2609d5de44b63eee0ce/2026-06/Stacey_13_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳詠詩於哥倫比亞大學科技管理碩士畢業。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/e1ad6e5cc5134ebce76ba582444ca66c/2025-07/staceydevinachan_1748167974_3640219272119588609_6887586.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳詠詩遙距升讀教育博士課程。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/1771c41e7ae0def2236ad673387f237b/2025-07/staceydevinachan_1748167974_3640219271968626779_6887586.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳詠詩母親為香港芭蕾舞學校創辦人。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/d682730ea5184e24c95c12672b38a07b/2025-07/staceydevinachan_1748167974_3640219272002402934_6887586.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳詠詩化身性感天使，貼身純白喱士吊帶馬甲將其飽滿上圍完美呈現。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/8ffa84050c97d92c8923454e459540e3/2026-11/SaveClip_App_883080584_18647589598039587_1993604145083822820_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳詠詩側身輕撫秀髮甜笑，魔鬼身材散發出撩人魅力。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/48f42ff7131f7c378c80d2aa47f6ff59/2026-11/SaveClip_App_886340653_18647589583039587_732559378678704187_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳詠詩微側俏臉眼神迷離，更顯性感與神祕。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/8395af8fcef6d4ae134ba4a18912d29d/2026-11/SaveClip_App_886518544_18647589574039587_8349737027615083295_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳詠詩身穿桃紅色貼身低胸短裙出席活動，大晒逆天長腿與驕人身材。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/f1bc61a05c53844b2435278f74481978/2026-11/SaveClip_App_584921139_18546832618039587_2658329516670922659_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳詠詩換上淡紫色半透視立體花束裙，配戴閃耀鑽鏈，盡顯女神風範。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/5d25a4e443d113611a2aea1d638183d1/2026-11/SaveClip_App_671027742_18583385239039587_7240321660843977118_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳詠詩身穿深V白紗裙手托香腮，眼神溫柔，散發優雅仙氣。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/3ff579675dd2f159618addae17b1e65f/2026-11/SaveClip_App_705757831_18594584269039587_6745318158563519654_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳詠詩以黑色皮革馬甲配型格大褸抱着萌寵，展現超強氣場與火辣長腿。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/03ea6a897db687562762bfd10aff2bee/2026-11/SaveClip_App_720086561_18599622043039587_2268473664052234440_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳詠詩戴上華麗港姐皇冠，身穿露肩晚裝回眸甜笑，高貴大方。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/9ee66d4201503b8abb6243a36c8e2d2b/2026-11/SaveClip_App_587599332_18546029938039587_8980093259275082062_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳詠詩早前在IG分享水著相，大晒好身材。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/69453d3d396c5319c05ac947e60e1a5b/2026-06/Stacey_3_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳詠詩的水著相，睇到網民流鼻血。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/464bc4ba795f2d0743718230821f95b5/2026-06/Stacey_2_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳詠詩身上的比堅尼，僅遮住重要部位。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/abb23ca6c6d1a9e42505c4c33248342f/2026-06/Stacey_1_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳詠詩的泳衣健康性感。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/591b8f6f00ed3003cc6fa5ac37d64288/2026-06/Stacey_4_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳詠詩愛以性感造型示人。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/e9d555a245ca59ad2555c4f5c4a85b9f/2025-09/b10.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳詠詩大晒驕人身材。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/e9d1b8702b1ea43631af8232edba78d2/2025-09/b9.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳詠詩的IG有不少性感泳裝。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/592e6e65b8672bd1087c006ec524f599/2025-09/b8.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳詠詩經常分享水著靚相。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/1d211da53ed249c657c06b6d5291b53b/2026-06/Stacey_16_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳詠詩泳衣設計相當大膽。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/dcff6b6e08920a5f119460267c6394aa/2025-09/b6_0.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳詠詩似乎好喜愛紅色色系。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/99e05ccb839b89d0badd53f3426a278a/2026-06/Stacey_17_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳詠詩大晒好身材。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/5c1f9c80acecfe9e1b67971e39a4517f/2026-06/Stacey_18_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳詠詩晒浸溫泉相。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/9b030358b6944f1b6c3f136192644ef9/2025-09/b12.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳詠詩愛晒身材。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/578c8f57ddb11e8c44b529ad60ca700f/2025-09/b13.jpg\"/>\n<h2>陳詠詩家世顯赫曾祖父為米業大亨</h2>\n<p>事實上，陳詠詩不僅身材惹火，更是名副其實的「頂級學霸」，身為前香港藝術體操代表隊成員的她，先後在加州大學柏克萊分校及哥倫比亞大學取得學士與科技管理碩士學位，目前正於倫敦大學學院（UCL）遙距攻讀教育博士，更曾於科技巨頭亞馬遜工作兩年。此外，她的家境亦極為顯赫，曾祖父為米業大亨陳瑞祺，母親則是香港芭蕾舞學校創辦人。不過陳詠詩早已名花有主，與南加州大學結識的男友Martin自2023年拍拖至今感情依舊甜蜜，這次罕有大解放讓網民大飽眼福。</p>\n<img alt=\"陳詠詩卸任港姐冠軍即大派福利。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/d824ca40ac80b53bf93382f2830cf4a9/2026-06/Stacey_6_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳詠詩透露男友是圈外人，表示想保護男友。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/93bd876e0242eebe946013309912bae4/2025-06/3_4_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳詠詩男友是學霸。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/07c0e1872dca8845324d73c9417ff26d/2025-09/260518462_822908408451419_3032925535366841308_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳詠詩當選後未有收埋男友。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/18d91a3064b0d63cbf634168fea40f01/2025-12/WhatsApp_Image_2025-12-18_at_13_35_36_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳詠詩27歲生日時，大晒與男友親密咀嘴照。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/d7f971575e724880307ceeddc908ad32/2025-12/WhatsApp_Image_2025-12-18_at_13_35_38.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳詠詩情到濃時，與男友放閃。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/69a64f5a99446e93f978c82cfe4365d8/2025-12/WhatsApp_Image_2025-12-18_at_13_35_37.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳詠詩早前被爆有男士甜蜜接機，其後大方認愛「眼鏡男」。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/89485c20fba769850638278a3509316b/2025-07/staceydevinachan_1748167974_3640219272128155317_6887586.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳詠詩男朋友Martin是南加州大學學霸。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/b43353663d2da452130cf80bbab7c5f3/2025-07/staceydevinachan_1748167974_3640219271968790733_6887586.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳詠詩與男友Martin愛得火熱。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/9137c23932c74f8c6cca6df20a696027/2025-07/staceydevinachan_1748167975_3640219273554124840_6887586.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳詠詩卸任港姐後，未見圈內的工作。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/ac5e203f3ffd568daec8f9bc913279d3/2026-06/Stacey_12_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳詠詩在紐約讀完碩士。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/2c93bcea4bebfc3e3a1bf07434123eb6/2025-06/3_1__1.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"香港小姐2025三甲分別為冠軍陳詠詩、亞軍施宇琪及季軍袁文靜。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/d298ccdb5939a1870e2b019bbf539d7c/2025-08/WhatsApp_Image_2025-08-31_at_11_36_08_PM.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"2025年港姐冠軍陳詠詩、亞軍施宇琪、季軍袁文靜卸任在即。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/41b33f115ed9b4f68e7ae34f3bc537f5/2025-08/WhatsApp_Image_2025-08-31_at_11_36_09_PM.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳詠詩的爸爸及妹妹入場支持。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/ef297bad8540fe771ae1bca0299bc51a/2025-08/VS--LIVE81-myTVSUPER-29277534_31_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳詠詩透露妹妹是特意由美國回港。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/c1e17bf364de675fbc117341abd110ca/2025-08/VS--LIVE81-myTVSUPER-29277534_09_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳詠詩爸爸出鏡。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/1b6c809eda051edc6034553937e030a2/2025-08/VS--LIVE81-myTVSUPER-29277536_01_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳詠詩兩姊妹的高顏值遺傳自母親。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/52585c2d5536de0fa194e5795bbd6142/2025-09/A1_0_0.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"冠軍陳詠詩高顏值母曝光。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/3130c5b5da3404d29152ac489c088bfe/2025-09/A2_2.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳詠詩不時貼出母女合照。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/89e5be94b32509385b6bb09ed0f6deab/2025-09/A3_0.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳詠詩的媽咪顏值爆燈。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/c4359bbba9e24ddb73f52bfbfd0947fc/2025-07/staceydevinachan_1748167974_3640219271985615177_6887586.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳詠詩與媽媽合照。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/288d09964756fe27933f6f640dd0c78d/2025-07/staceydevinachan_1748167974_3640219271968832258_6887586.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳詠詩的曾祖父是陳瑞祺。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/951bc19d46100b1ac5433c10378088f6/2025-07/333_0.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳詠詩曾跟家人返鄉下。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/a3f6c9968d658c10532a61f54385d784/2025-07/111_2__0.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳詠詩回鄉跟親友見面。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/276e7ca95355a1dabd876cae13bc001d/2025-07/111_1__1.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳詠詩在美國是啦啦隊成員。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/335185ab56c095c695d876d1f74c3590/2025-09/b11.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳詠詩是藝術體操運動員。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/50b3dd3373913406b00434b2d6ebd931/2025-07/staceydevinachan_1497856418_1540453746751117114_6887586.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳詠詩曾是港隊成員。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/a44b835ffd5e37f467104265f4766501/2025-07/staceydevinachan_1490976016_1482736750610444601_6887586.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳詠詩曾代表香港外出比賽。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/fa995a2226abd6399f270273f926ae78/2025-07/staceydevinachan_1442112194_1072837307547545583_6887586.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳詠詩經常在IG貼運動相。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/7477a03bf3d1d762c495202537837e99/2025-07/staceydevinachan_1466424506_1276783754847219694_6887586.jpg\"/>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-04T05:25:34.198395+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":621,"images":55,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-04T05:00:09+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-04T09:38:58.732267+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-04T05:18:52.051076+00:00",